# ---- Large / regenerable binaries — kept out of git (GitHub's 100 MB hard limit) ----
# These are all reproducible from committed source, or hosted on GitHub releases.

# Trained surrogates (fetch via `make model`; released as surrogate-v1 / pl_unet3d)
*.onnx
*.pt

# Training dataset shards (regenerate with the phase_b notebooks, or `make dataset-fetch`)
*.npz

# Outdoor city voxel grids — ~347 MB each; regenerate with voxelize_city.py
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/city/

# Diffraction relay cache — ~376 MB at 16 edges; rebuilt automatically by
# precompute_volumes.py on first run (~75 s), then reused by every transmitter.
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/cache/

# ---- OS / Python junk ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# scene_v1_backup/ — pre-M0.4 grid, kept locally for rollback (not versioned)
Physics Engine/3D Map Physics/SIM V1 3D/scene_v1_backup/
